<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>彭博社 实时热点</title><link>https://feeds.bloomberg.com/markets/news.rss</link><description>彭博社 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 19:00:03 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>股市崩盘蔓延至不太可能的市场，套利交易陷入困境</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/stocks-meltdown-spills-into-unlikely-market-sinking-carry-trade</link><description>华尔街 2026 年最可靠的押注之一正开始失去其万无一失的地位。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/stocks-meltdown-spills-into-unlikely-market-sinking-carry-trade'&gt;股市崩盘蔓延至不太可能的市场，套利交易陷入困境&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Stocks Selloff Hits Unlikely Market, Sinking Carry Trade&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/stocks-meltdown-spills-into-unlikely-market-sinking-carry-trade</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 14:01:11 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>Aareal 银行为 SRT 风险最高的部分提供超过 12% 的溢价</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/aareal-bank-nears-commercial-real-estate-srt-with-12-premium</link><description>Aareal Bank AG 将向投资者支付超过 12% 的溢价，以对冲价值约 25 亿欧元（合 27 亿美元）的商业房地产贷款账簿的部分风险，这只是其第二笔此类交易。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/aareal-bank-nears-commercial-real-estate-srt-with-12-premium'&gt;Aareal 银行为 SRT 风险最高的部分提供超过 12% 的溢价&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Aareal Bank Offers Over 12% Premium on Riskiest Part of SRT&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/aareal-bank-nears-commercial-real-estate-srt-with-12-premium</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 10:04:32 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>CME E-Mini 期权在开盘混乱期间短暂暂停</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/cme-e-mini-options-briefly-paused-during-chaotic-opening-session</link><description>周三股市开盘后，由于交易所风险管理系统启动，交易者无法进行 E-mini S&amp;P 500 指数期权交易，导致交易者在抛售开始和波动性增加期间无法进场或退出头寸。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/cme-e-mini-options-briefly-paused-during-chaotic-opening-session'&gt;CME E-Mini 期权在开盘混乱期间短暂暂停&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：CME E-Mini Options Briefly Paused During Chaotic Opening Session&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/cme-e-mini-options-briefly-paused-during-chaotic-opening-session</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 18:37:00 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>陆军炸毁危险物品，最担心的事情并未成为现实</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/army-blows-up-hazardous-material-in-iowa-video</link><description>陆军炸毁了储存在爱荷华州一处设施中的五吨危险材料，早期迹象表明规划者已经避免了周围社区上空飘浮的大量有毒铅云的最坏情况。 （来源：彭博社）&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/army-blows-up-hazardous-material-in-iowa-video'&gt;陆军炸毁危险物品，最担心的事情并未成为现实&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Army Blows Up Hazardous Material With Worst Fears Unrealized&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/army-blows-up-hazardous-material-in-iowa-video</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 18:51:04 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>由于挥之不去的人工智能担忧，美国科技股将继续下跌</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/us-stock-index-futures-slide-as-ai-worries-fuel-tech-losses</link><description>由于投资者担心人工智能建设的巨额投资的回报，美国科技股预计将连续第二天下跌。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/us-stock-index-futures-slide-as-ai-worries-fuel-tech-losses'&gt;由于挥之不去的人工智能担忧，美国科技股将继续下跌&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Nasdaq 100 Bounces Off Tech-Driven Lows as Dip Buyers Emerge&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/us-stock-index-futures-slide-as-ai-worries-fuel-tech-losses</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 07:51:43 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>